Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Solar Radiation Pressure", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.00108033028469*^9, 
  4.0010803543551617`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2fc58876-21a7-4939-91c0-\
180b88224eff"],

Cell["\<\
The SRP is mainly inelastic (maybe 10% elastic) and 30% efficient. The sun \
rotates round the earth-moon system on the moon time frame so the SRP rotates \
around the outside of the system.  SRP has completely negligible  effect on \
the earth and moon.  The 70% power loss is clearly generating heat.  It must \
be re-radiated which will produce some potentially directed (and maybe \
directable) additional forces.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0010802054706917`*^9, 4.0010803190633297`*^9}, {
  4.0010808684086227`*^9, 4.0010809191075325`*^9}, {4.001081018610442*^9, 
